.TH MEOW 1
.SH NAME
meow \\- transform text into configurable cat sounds
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B meow
meow [OPTIONS] [TEXT ...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Reads text from arguments, a file, or standard input and applies deterministic or randomized cat-sound transformations. It supports text, JSON, and NDJSON output.
.SH OPTIONS
Use \fBmeow --help\fR for the complete, version-specific flag list.
.SH EXIT STATUS
Uses the shared CLI status convention: 0 success, 1 a completed negative finding or policy failure, 2 invalid usage, 3 a partial result, and 4 a runtime failure. Not every status applies to every command.
